  "contentHtml": "<p>저희 학교는</p><p>7/9(금)에&#160;</p><p>학생, 학부모, 교직원들과 함께</p><p>환경 캠페인 행사를 하려고 합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>환경운동연합과 공동으로 진행하구요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>오프닝으로 이 영상을 상영하구요.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bm-FaiKG3L4\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bm-FaiKG3L4</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bm-FaiKG3L4\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"500\" data-video-height=\"281\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bHE0zS/hyKHPeplrE/SizKB2dTlCgi9MhSKtooEk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bm-FaiKG3L4\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>1학기에 학생들이 운영했던&#160;</p><p>제로웨이스트, 용기내 캠페인, 나눔폰 캠페인 등 사례 발표합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c454b3b16ce631e36fc19127fa59bd1c2e77408\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" height=\"426\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c454b3b16ce631e36fc19127fa59bd1c2e77408\" data-origin-width=\"435\" data-origin-height=\"617\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c412c74722b914421e2bd3498afd2fd409592419\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c412c74722b914421e2bd3498afd2fd409592419\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35fb43c77f561b0d3a4f0ca8c888abaf64e8d924\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" height=\"282\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35fb43c77f561b0d3a4f0ca8c888abaf64e8d924\" data-origin-width=\"907\" data-origin-height=\"853\"></div><p>이번 환경 캠페인 행사에</p><p>또 어떤 것을 하면 의미있을까요?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>행사 마무리에서</p><p>뭔가 임팩트 있는 활동이 있으면 좋겠습니다.</p><p>공동 결의문 낭독, 우리의 약속 등은 좀 식상할 것 같구요^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>뭔가 재미있는 활동이 있을까요?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>선생님들의 다양한 아이디어 공유 부탁드립니다!</p><p>고맙습니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
